      "When entering into cell tower lease negotiations, having a strong support team is essential. Landlords typically have several options, including hiring a consultant, an attorney, or both. Understanding how each professional contributes - and how their strengths complement each other - can help you make the most informed decision. Given that many cell tower agreements last between 25 and 99 years, it’s critical to align yourself with trusted professionals who prioritize your long-term financial interests.",
