    {   heading: "Choosing Between a Cell Tower Attorney and a Consultant", level: 2, paragraphs: [
      "If you’re considering whether to hire an attorney, a consultant, or both, it’s important to understand the distinct roles each one plays.",
      "Cell Tower Attorneys An attorney specializes in the legal aspects of your agreement. They ensure the contract terms protect your interests, comply with applicable laws, and reduce your liability. However, attorneys are typically licensed to practice law only within specific states. If you own properties across multiple states, you may need to engage several attorneys. Moreover, most attorneys lack technical expertise in key industry areas - such as radio frequency (RF) design, equipment specifications, site valuation, pricing models, and industry-standard compensation structures - that are critical to assessing a lease’s true value.",
